<title>ESTONIA: TALLINNA FARMA REVISES UPWARD 1996 PROFITS.</title>
<headline>TALLINNA FARMA REVISES UPWARD 1996 PROFITS.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tallinna Farma said on Monday that it was revising slightly its 1996 unaudited net profit, increasing it to 29.6 million kroons from a previously stated 29.4 million kroons.</p>
<p>The bank also said in a statement that it was revising its 1996 pre-tax profit statement to 39.4 million kroons against a previously stated 39.3 million kroons.</p>
<p>The company made a 1995 pre-tax profit of 22.2 million kroons.</p>
<p>-- Tallinn newsroom +372 630 8400 reuters@reuters.ee</p>
</text>
